sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / SDK
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Webhook as Training Operator Webhook<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS TLS (cluster profile)
    participant Controller as Training Operator Controller<br/>Watch/Informer
    participant Pods as Worker/Master Pods
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>PodMonitor

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over User,Pods: Flow 1: Training Job Submission
        User->>K8sAPI: POST /apis/kubeflow.org/v1/.../pytorchjobs<br/>Auth: User credentials (kubeconfig)
        K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /validate-kubeflow-org-v1-pytorchjob<br/>HTTPS/9443, TLS (cluster profile)<br/>Auth: Kubernetes admission
        Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admission Response (Allow/Deny)

        Note over K8sAPI,Controller: Watch event via label-filtered informer
        K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch notification<br/>TLS 1.2+, ServiceAccount token

        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Pod (worker/master)<br/>HTTPS/6443, ServiceAccount token
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create headless Service<br/>HTTPS/6443, ServiceAccount token

        opt Gang Scheduling Enabled
            Controller->>K8sAPI: Create PodGroup<br/>(Volcano or scheduler-plugins)
        end

        opt PyTorch Elastic Training
            Controller->>K8sAPI: Create HorizontalPodAutoscaler<br/>HTTPS/6443
        end

        opt MPI Job
            Controller->>K8sAPI: Create ConfigMap (hostfile)<br/>+ ServiceAccount + Role + RoleBinding
        end

        K8sAPI->>Pods: Schedule and start pods
        Pods-->>K8sAPI: Status updates (Running/Succeeded/Failed)
        K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch status change
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Update job status<br/>(conditions, replica statuses)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over Prometheus,Controller: Flow 2: Metrics Collection
        Prometheus->>Controller: GET /metrics<br/>HTTP(S)/8080<br/>TLS (cluster profile)<br/>Auth: None (PodMonitor scrape)
        Controller-->>Prometheus: Prometheus metrics
    end
